      "page": 49,
      "quote": "Screen failure only applies to patients without treatment assignment. Patients who fail to meet the eligibility criteria should not, under any circumstances, be assigned to treatment. There can be no exceptions to this rule. Patients who are enrolled, but subsequently found not to meet all eligibility criteria must not initiate treatment and must be screen-failed.",
